# Generated from the Lean source by `scripts/generate-docs.sh` (bibgen, argdoc,
# argtex, statusgen, exampletex), and never committed: CI generates them for the
# site, the PDFs and each pull request's preview. Committed, every pull request
# that touched an argument or a citation edited them, and any two such pull
# requests conflicted. Three pages hold hand-written prose around a generated
# block; their source is in docs/templates/, and the page is generated from it.
/references.bib
docs/src/bibliography.md
docs/src/arguments/
docs/src/SUMMARY.md
docs/src/roadmap.md
docs/src/maturity.md
docs/latex/arguments.tex
docs/latex/arguments/*.tex

# LaTeX build products: everything the TeX engine derives from the generated
# documents.
docs/latex/*.pdf
docs/latex/*.aux
docs/latex/*.bbl
docs/latex/*.blg
docs/latex/*.log
docs/latex/*.xdv
docs/latex/references.bib
docs/latex/credits.def
docs/latex/arguments/*.pdf
docs/latex/arguments/*.aux
docs/latex/arguments/*.bbl
docs/latex/arguments/*.blg
docs/latex/arguments/*.log
docs/latex/arguments/*.xdv
docs/latex/arguments/references.bib
docs/latex/arguments/credits.def
